## 🚫 **BLOCKED ACTIONS**

### **No Test = No Completion**
- Cannot mark features as "done" without passing tests AND emotional validation
- Cannot claim functionality works without test evidence AND trust metrics
- Cannot proceed to next phase without test validation AND user empowerment confirmation
- Cannot close tickets without test documentation AND emotional impact assessment

### **No Test = No Deployment**
- Cannot deploy to staging without test suite passing AND emotional sovereignty validation
- Cannot deploy to production without comprehensive test validation AND trust transparency
- Cannot release features without end-to-end test confirmation AND user empowerment metrics
- Cannot update dependencies without regression test validation AND emotional continuity checks

### **No Test = No Documentation**
- Cannot document features as complete without test evidence AND emotional resonance validation
- Cannot create user guides without functional test validation AND empowerment confirmation
- Cannot publish API docs without integration test confirmation AND trust transparency
- Cannot claim capabilities without test proof AND emotional sovereignty evidence

### **No Test = No Sign-off**
- Cannot get stakeholder approval without test evidence AND trust metrics
- Cannot mark milestones complete without test validation AND emotional impact assessment
- Cannot proceed to next sprint without test confirmation AND user empowerment validation
- Cannot claim project success without comprehensive test results AND emotional sovereignty metrics

